ull, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/pulls/4", "html_url": "https://github.com/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/pull/4", "diff_url": "https://github.com/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/pull/4.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/pull/4.patch", "merged_at": "2026-10-20T18:46:05Z"}, "body": "## Summary\n\nA docs-only follow-up to Kghaffari26/sam-agent#3. The contractor intake form belongs in `Kghaffari26/construction-dashboard`, not agents-hub. This PR changes no code, because the recommender (`agents/grants/recommend.py`, `tools/setup_contractor.py`) doesn't depend on any particular dashboard.\n\n- `CLAUDE.md`: adds `construction-dashboard` to the repo split. Contractors enter their details there, and that intake feeds `tools/setup_contractor.py`.\n- `docs/specs/SPEC_GRANTS.md` \u00a72.1: says the intake comes from the construction dashboard.\n- `STATUS.md`: the intake form is listed as not done in construction-dashboard, which has no app code yet. agents-hub still only needs labels for the new reject codes.\n- `DECISIONS.md`: records the owner's correction.\n\nThe branch includes one merge commit, which merges this branch's pre-squash tip so the push didn't need a force-push. The resulting tree is `main` plus these four doc files.\n\n## Testing\n- `uv run pytest`: 294 passed. Docs only.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01XDHUMzRrdAa1sAeQcg6EKJ)_", "closed_by": {"login": "Kghaffari26", "id": 108359594, "node_id": "U_kgDOBnVvqg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108359594?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26", "html_url": "https://github.com/Kghaffari26", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.