b Pull Requests and Issues to respond to reviewer feedback, fix CI errors, or modify code, turning it into a virtual teammate that works alongside your development pipelines.\r\n\r\nThis is built on the publicly available Claude Code SDK.", "external_url": "https://anthropic.com/claude-code", "html_url": "https://github.com/apps/claude", "created_at": "2025-04-30T17:54:24Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-30T19:04:00Z", "permissions": {"actions": "write", "administration": "read", "checks": "write", "contents": "write", "discussions": "write", "issues": "write", "members": "read", "merge_queues": "read", "metadata": "read", "pull_requests": "write", "repository_hooks": "write", "statuses": "read", "workflows": "write"}, "events": ["branch_protection_rule", "check_run", "check_suite", "commit_comment", "discussion", "discussion_comment", "issues", "issue_comment", "merge_group", "merge_queue_entry", "pull_request", "pull_request_review", "pull_request_review_comment", "pull_request_review_thread", "push", "release", "repository_ruleset", "status", "sub_issues"]}, "state_reason": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/issues/3", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kghaffari26/sam-agent", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/issues/3/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/issues/3/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/issues/3/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/pull/3", "id": 5946475851, "node_id": "PR_kwDOUolC4c8AAAABJm9U-w", "number": 3, "title": "Profile filters, scoring preferences and contractor setup", "user": {"login": "Kghaffari26", "id": 108359594, "node_id": "U_kgDOBnVvqg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108359594?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26", "html_url": "https://github.com/Kghaffari26", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 0, "created_at": "2026-10-20T17:34:09Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-20T17:41:13Z", "closed_at": "2026-10-20T17:41:13Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "OWNER", "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/pulls/3", "html_url": "https://github.com/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/pull/3", "diff_url": "https://github.com/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/pull/3.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/pull/3.patch", "merged_at": "2026-10-20T17:41:13Z"}, "body": "## Summary\n\nAdds three things to the grants agent:\n\n### 1. `[filters]` in the business profile (SPEC \u00a75.2a)\n- **SAM.gov's own search filters:**\n  - NAICS and PSC: exact codes or prefixes such as `5415`. Contracts only; a contract with no code listed passes.\n  - Agency: matches agency, sub-agency or office.\n  - Set-aside: `NONE` means unrestricted.\n  - Keywords: any of / all of, over title + description.\n  - Posted within N days, due within N days.\n- **Filters the website doesn't have:**\n  - Exclude sole-source set-asides and \"intent to sole source / award\" notices.\n  - Check negative keywords against the description too.\n  - Require a deadline, or a known value.\n- **Applied locally**, after the SAM window fetch, which stays unfiltered. A server-side filter would leave a permanent gap in the fetched window whenever someone loosened it.\n- **Output:** ten additive `stats.rejected` codes (SPEC \u00a76.4). The schema snapshot is regenerated. agents-hub reads `stats.rejected` as `z.record`, so the current site accepts them and shows the raw codes until it adds labels.\n\n### 2. `[scoring]` (SPEC \u00a75.4a)\n- Rubric weights (must sum to 100), a set-aside bonus, and Pursue/Consider bands for each profile.\n- All applied in code. `refinalize` re-applies them to cached scores, so no LLM rescore is needed.\n- The default weights equal the rubric ranges, so fit is exactly the old sum.\n- `latest.json` `thresholds` publishes the bands actually in effect.\n\n### 3. Contractor setup (SPEC \u00a72.1)\n- `agents/grants/recommend.py` turns a contractor's dashboard intake into a full profile with recommended filters and scoring, and a reason for each choice.\n- It is rule-based over a catalog of 17 federal trades: no LLM, no network.\n- `tools/setup_contractor.py` writes `config/profiles/<id>.toml` with the reasons as comments. Options: `--activate`, `--json` (for the dashboard), `--schema` (to build the intake form from).\n- Examples: `config/intakes/*.json` \u2192 `config/profiles/*.toml`.\n\n### Caching / cost\n- `[filters]` and `[scoring]` are left out of `profile_hash` (`CODE_ONLY_SECTIONS`) because neither reaches a prompt.\n- The live profile's hash is unchanged (`a872b5b\u2026`, matches `data/grants/state.json`), so cached scores stay valid.\n- No prompt changed, so no evals were run.\n\n## Testing\n- `uv run pytest`: 294 passed (245 before; all earlier tests unchanged).\n- `ruff check .`: clean.\n- No agent runs, no SAM requests, $0 spent.\n\n## Follow-up (agents-hub)\n- An intake form built from `setup_contractor --schema`.\n- Labels for the new reject codes.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01XDHUMzRrdAa1sAeQcg6EKJ)_", "closed_by": {"login": "Kghaffari26", "id": 108359594, "node_id": "U_kgDOBnVvqg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108359594?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26", "html_url": "https://github.com/Kghaffari26", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Kghaffari26/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/issues/3/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kghaffari26/sam-agent/issues/3/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": {"id": 1236702, "client_id": "Iv23liqTIFEtdIu6Vn1r", "slug": "claude", "node_id": "A_kwHOBIuudM4AEt7e", "owner": {"login": "anthropics", "id": 76263028, "node_id": "MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjc2MjYzMDI4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76263028?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/anthropics", "html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/anthropics/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/anthropics/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/anthropic